===
title: Russell
---
Russell: Hey there.
Russell: Rosaline not here today?
-> She'll be right back.
-> She's smoking.
You: I'm, uh... filling in, in the meantime.
You: Should only be a few minutes.
Russell: Are you even old enough to serve drinks?
You: Sure. Unless you're a cop.
Russell: Ha, no chance.
Russell: I'll go easy on you, then.
Russell: I'll have a vodka soda.
(here lies a drink mixing game)
You: Here you go. I did my best.
Russell: Hard to mess it up.
Russell: Thanks. 
You: You're Penny's dad? I don't think I've seen you around.

// before this point, penny will have brought up her father in passing
Russell: You would've if you were at the bar more often.
Russell: I hope Penny isn't giving you much trouble.
-> Not at all.
    Russell: Haha. You don't have to lie about it.
-> A little...
Russell: She's just a bit lonely.
Russell: Feels bad, you know? That I can't give her the attention she needs.
Russell: Ever since...
Russell: Ah, I'm sure you get it. We're all struggling.
Russell: My wife was the more attentive one, you know? More cut out to be a parent than I am.
Russell: It's been hard to find work. With most places still being closed down and all.
Russell: Work that pays the bills, anyways...
Russell: Rosaline's nice enough to slip us some food to take home.
Russell: I'm talking too much about myself.
Russell: You seem to have enough on your plate. Rosaline says you might not be able to sell drinks anymore.
You: Yeah. I guess we're the only business for miles ordering alcohol.
You: Since the real bar was never rebuilt.
You: Our supplier says they're losing money by delivering out here.
You: They want us to make bigger orders or they're gonna stop delivering to us. But we can't afford that.
You: We're all a little stressed. People really only come here to drink.
You: Tom is trying to work something out right now, but... he didn't seem optimistic.
Russell: I'm sorry to hear about that. 
Russell: I hope it all works out.
You: Me too.
Russell: Well, what I meant to tell you--
Russell: Thanks for being patient with my kid, Casey.
(hi the game ends here for now)
<<deactivate_npc NPCManager>>



