title: Alcoholic
---
Hey, you! Bartender!
Get me another drink, would you?
I've been standing here forever!
You: I... um...
Why are you just staring at me?
You: (She must've died wasted. Does she even know she's dead?)
You: (...I don't want to think about that.)
You: (Even if I make her a drink, she wouldn't be able to drink it.)
You: (I have to find another way to get her to leave.)
You: (She's so drunk, maybe I can get away with lying to her.)
[dialogue minigame]
Oh, damn. I'm really that drunk?
...Okay. I'll go.
But I'll be back. 
<<completed_task NPCManager>>
<<deactivate_npc NPCManager>>
