title: Penny_1
---
Penny: Hi, Casey!
You: ...
You: Hi, Penny.
You: Back so soon...?
Penny: Yep! My dad says I don't have any chores at home, so I can stay as long as I want.
You: That's... great.
You: (She's always here. I really hope she doesn't bother me too much today.)
You: Do you need something...?
Penny: This game won't turn on! Again! Why does this always happen?
Penny: Can you fix it?
You: I'll take a look at it. Just a second.
Penny: Thank you!
(wires minigame here?)
Penny: Woah, you fixed it!
Penny: Do you wanna play it with me?
You: Sorry, Penny. I'm working.
You: Maybe another time.
Penny: Aw... okay.
Penny: Well, thanks anyway!
<<completed_task NPCManager>>
<<deactivate_npc NPCManager>>

