Penny: Hey! Can I get a prize?
You: Already? Don't you want to... um, save up more tickets?
Penny: No, no! What if someone takes the prize I want before I can get it?
You: (...There's almost no one else here.)
You: Okay, fine. Which one do you want?
Penny: I'll show you!
(prize minigame here)
You: There you go. 
Penny: Thanks!
You: Do you need anything else? ...Before I walk away?
Penny: Nope. All good!
You: ...You sure?
Penny: Mhm!
You: Okay.
<<deactivate_npc NPCManager>>
